+      "statement": "For N=4M-5 complex Gaussian measurements, the cached conjecture asks both p_M<1 and p_M->0. The explicit transverse-frame proof candidate establishes the first clause for every M>=2 and gives p_2=p_3=0. It supplies no uniform probability bound in M, so the asymptotic clause remains unresolved. No solution is reported before w346 KEEP and full proof audit; novelty is unverified.",
